{"seq":4,"slug":"advanced-models","title":"高级模型","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/derivatives-pricing/advanced-models","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"stochastic-volatility","title":"随机波动率模型：Heston 与 SABR","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/derivatives-pricing/advanced-models/stochastic-volatility","wordCount":2019,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"interest-rate-models","title":"利率模型与固定收益定价","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/derivatives-pricing/advanced-models/interest-rate-models","wordCount":2178,"readingTime":9},{"seq":3,"slug":"credit-derivatives","title":"信用衍生品与违约模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/derivatives-pricing/advanced-models/credit-derivatives","wordCount":2342,"readingTime":10}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"高级模型\">高级模型</h1><p>本章探讨超越 Black-Scholes 框架的前沿定价模型。随机波动率模型（Heston、SABR）通过让波动率自身成为随机过程来捕捉市场中的波动率微笑；利率模型（Vasicek、CIR、HJM、LMM）为固定收益衍生品提供期限结构一致的定价框架；信用衍生品模型则处理违约风险的量化与 CDS/CDO 的定价问题。三篇文档展示当代量化金融中最重要的高级定价技术。</p>\n"}